// Title: File Download Via Nscurl - MacOS
// Rule ID: 6d8a7cf1-8085-423b-b87d-7e880faabbdf
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.command-and-control, attack.t1105
// Category: process_creation
